            <item>
        <title>WallX 1.0.8</title>
        <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
        <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
        <description><![CDATA[
            <ul>
                <li><b>Self-healing lock screen</b> — if the active wallpaper's file goes missing, WallX now automatically falls back to your most recent video instead of dropping to a solid color.</li>
                <li><b>Current wallpaper shown in the menu</b> — the popover now tells you which video is set as your lock screen.</li>
                <li><b>Discord + Help buttons</b> — jump straight to the community server and project page from the menu.</li>
                <li><b>Screensaver support</b> — use your WallX videos as a screensaver too (Settings → Screen Saver). Quietly added in 1.0.7.2 — give it a try if you missed it.</li>
            </ul>
        ]]></description>
